    "statement": "Construct common R/S; for each y fix original D_y before epsilon/f, choose ONE u before ALL C2 compact chi. Retain original exact D graph, dense/closable/closed properties, all-domain positive-epsilon variational identity, ordinary locally integrable u/G, all-C1 compact directional weak-gradient identities, local squared-r integrability, compact-volumeL2 of u/G/r, original all-C2 PDE, and all actual localized volumeL2/support/first/second weak identities. The actual volumeL2 properties are retained; actual vL/FL/gradL quotient classes are returned with all three AE links and bind the simultaneous limits. For each cutoff apply the shared actual producer: Derive one real Schwartz sequence phi_n with one common outer compact Kprime containing every tsupport(phi_n), chosen before all n and all three limits. Actual volumeL2 classes of phi_n converge to v; actual classical gradient(phi_n) is MemLp2 and its class converges to the actual Gchi; actual Laplacian(phi_n) classes converge to Fchi. Every phi_n is C-infinity and compactly supported. The same sequence realizes all limits. Kprime need not equal K. No classical derivatives of rough v, real Hessian family, quantitative source complexity constant or weighted operator core is claimed.",
